IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID: STORAGE-TEST.

*> 這份檢查器不需要修改，是這一題的驗收標準。

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  CK-TOTAL    PIC S9(9)V99.
01  CK-LARGEST  PIC S9(4).
01  CK-IDX      PIC 9(4).
01  CK-BIN      PIC S9(5)V99.
01  CK-PACKED   PIC S9(5)V99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
COBLINGS-TEST-MAIN.
    PERFORM LOAD-ITEMS

    PERFORM SUM-ITEMS
    MOVE WS-TOTAL TO CK-TOTAL
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "SUM-ITEMS：100+200+300+400+500"
              BY CONTENT 1500
              BY CONTENT CK-TOTAL

    PERFORM FIND-LARGEST
    MOVE WS-LARGEST TO CK-LARGEST
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "FIND-LARGEST：最後一筆的金額"
              BY CONTENT 500
              BY CONTENT CK-LARGEST
    MOVE WS-LARGEST-IDX TO CK-IDX
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "FIND-LARGEST：INDEX 應該停在第 5 格"
              BY CONTENT 5
              BY CONTENT CK-IDX

*> COMP 與 COMP-3 只是存法不同，數值必須一樣
    PERFORM COPY-TO-BOTH
    MOVE WS-BIN-COUNT TO CK-BIN
    MOVE WS-PACKED-RATE TO CK-PACKED
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "COMP 與 COMP-3 存起來的數值要相同"
              BY CONTENT CK-BIN
              BY CONTENT CK-PACKED
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "COMP-3 可以存負數"
              BY CONTENT -1234.56
              BY CONTENT CK-PACKED

    CALL "COBLINGS-DONE"
    GOBACK.
